<Page
  metaTitle="MAME Arcade Machines & Emulator Cabinets — DreamAuthentics"
  title="MAME &amp; Emulator Arcade Machines"
  eyebrow="Works With Any Emulator"
  blurb="100% MAME compatible. Our custom home arcades run MAME and every major front end and emulator — so you can play the greatest games ever made on a machine built by hand, just for you."
  description="DreamAuthentics custom arcade machines are 100% MAME compatible and run any emulator or front end. Up to 30,000 retro games, licensed content plus your own legally-owned library, on a handcrafted cabinet. Built in the USA since 2000.">
  <div style="text-align:center">
    <img src="/img/cab/works-mame.jpg" alt="DreamAuthentics arcades work with any emulator — 100% MAME compatible" style="max-width:100%;border-radius:12px;margin:0 auto"/>
    <div style="max-width:760px;margin:28px auto;text-align:left;color:var(--mut);font-size:1.08rem;line-height:1.7">
      <p>Every DreamAuthentics cabinet is a real, commercial-grade arcade — and it plays like one. Under the museum-grade artwork sits a purpose-built gaming PC that runs <strong>MAME</strong>, <strong>RetroArch</strong>, <strong>LaunchBox / BigBox</strong>, <strong>HyperSpin</strong> and every major emulator and front end. Arcade, console, and computer classics, all launched from one gorgeous menu.</p>
      <p>We ship each machine loaded with <strong>fully-licensed content</strong>, and you can add your own <strong>legally-owned game library</strong> — up to <strong>30,000 titles</strong> across every platform. Any game, any controller, any era. When someone asks "can I play <em>____</em> on it?" the answer is <strong>yes</strong>.</p>
      <p>Twenty-plus years of building the finest custom home arcades on the planet means the emulation is dialed in, the controls feel authentic, and it just works — plug it in and play.</p>
    </div>
    <a class="btn" href="/contact/">Start Your Build</a>
    &nbsp;<a class="btn ghost" href="/game-list/">See The Game List</a>
  </div>
</Page>
